00:27:57,507 --> 00:28:26,498
I'd like to take certain papers out of order. I'd like to take the elections papers 26143, 26144, and 26145 out of order. On the motion of Councilor Callahan to suspend the rules to take papers 26143, 26144, and 26145, seconded by Vice President Lazaro. Mr. Clerk, please call the roll. Councilor Callahan. Councilor Lemming. Yes.

61
00:28:27,781 --> 00:28:37,113
Council Malone. Yes. Councilor Scarpelli. Yes. Councilor Singh. Yes. Vice President Lazaro. Yes. And President Pierce.

