63
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:26,371
Through you Mr. President. Unfortunately the timing of this is not great but I don't have any influence on construction in the city so we're in the situation we're in. Ward 4 Precinct 2 is the current voting location is Walkman Court.

64
00:29:27,080 --> 00:29:46,300
And it'll be changing to Tufts the Gancher Center, which currently houses Ward 4 precinct 1 So there's enough room. We've had discussions with Tufts About housing both polling locations at that location. They are completely agreeable and we haven't had

65
