Motion approved by Vice President Lazaro, seconded by Councilor Sang. I have one question for you, Jim. I have been getting some questions about the changes for polling workers and bringing them on as employees. And I know a number of poll workers are frustrated by that process. And also, I did hear from one poll worker that the city council was ordering you to do this, and I don't think we've ever talked about it. So I just wanted to ask what this change is, where it's coming from, and also,

76
00:34:37,512 --> 00:35:03,314
say that it's not coming from the city council. Yeah it's a policy change by the city. It was legal opinion stated to the city as a good practice that many cities and towns are doing. It covers financial mainly when it comes to if something were to happen to that employee if they sought further employment somewhere else you

77
